<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Experience (GenAI) | Arnav Karekar</title>
<style>
	@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');

	:root {
		--ink: #252129;
		--muted: #716875;
		--paper: #f6f0e8;
		--card: #fffaf3;
		--coral: #e86f51;
		--blue: #315c72;
		--line: #dbcfc3;
	}

	* { box-sizing: border-box; }

	body {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--ink);
		background: var(--paper);
		font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.page {
		width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 40px));
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 28px 0 70px;
	}

	.topbar {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 20px;
		padding-bottom: 22px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
	}

	.brand {
		color: var(--ink);
		font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.03em;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; justify-content: flex-end; }
	nav a { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.84rem; text-decoration: none; }
	nav a:hover, nav a[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--coral); }

	.intro {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(220px, 0.7fr);
		gap: 50px;
		align-items: end;
		padding: 82px 0 64px;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		color: var(--coral);
		font-size: 0.76rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; line-height: 1.1; }
	h1 { max-width: 680px; margin: 14px 0 20px; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.8rem); letter-spacing: -0.05em; }
	.intro p { max-width: 600px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; }

	.signal {
		padding: 22px;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-top: 4px solid var(--coral);
		background: var(--card);
		box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 #e5d8ca;
		animation: lift-in 700ms ease both;
	}

	.signal strong { display: block; color: var(--blue); font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 1.4rem; }
	.signal span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }

	.experience-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
	h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.8rem; }
	.experience-heading p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }

	.timeline { position: relative; margin-left: 10px; padding-left: 36px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.role { position: relative; margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 26px 28px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); animation: lift-in 700ms ease both; }
	.role::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 11px; height: 11px; left: -43px; top: 31px; border: 3px solid var(--paper); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--coral); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--coral); }
	.role:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 80ms; }
	.role:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 160ms; }
	.role:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 240ms; }
	.role:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 320ms; }
	.role:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 400ms; }
	.role-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.78rem; }
	.role h3 { margin: 7px 0 5px; color: var(--blue); font-size: 1.35rem; }
	.role p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
	.role a { color: var(--coral); }

	footer { margin-top: 58px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; text-align: center; }
	footer a { color: var(--blue); }

	@keyframes lift-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.page { width: min(100% - 28px, 560px); padding-top: 18px; }
		.topbar, .intro { display: block; }
		nav { justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 14px; }
		.intro { padding: 58px 0 48px; }
		.signal { margin-top: 34px; }
		.experience-heading { display: block; }
		.experience-heading p { margin-top: 8px; }
		.role { padding: 22px 20px; }
	}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<main class="page">
	<header class="topbar">
		<a class="brand" href="index.html">AK / 2026</a>
		<nav aria-label="Main navigation">
			<a href="index.html">Home</a>
			<a href="activities.html">Activities</a>
			<a href="portfolio.html">Portfolio</a>
			<a href="genai.thml" aria-current="page">Experience (GenAI)</a>
		</nav>
	</header>

	<section class="intro">
		<div>
			<div class="eyebrow">Selected work / experience</div>
			<h1>Building useful systems with a security mindset.</h1>
			<p>I am Arnav Karekar, a computer science student at Texas A&amp;M University working across cybersecurity, software development, research, and thoughtful product design.</p>
		</div>
		<aside class="signal">
			<strong>6 chapters</strong>
			<span>From web design and product thinking to security operations and malware research.</span>
		</aside>
	</section>

	<section aria-labelledby="timeline-title">
		<div class="experience-heading">
			<h2 id="timeline-title">Experience timeline</h2>
			<p>Technology, research, and people-first problem solving.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="timeline">
			<article class="role">
				<div class="role-meta"><span>Oct 2025 - Present</span><span>Texas A&amp;M Technology Services</span></div>
				<h3>Student Technician</h3>
				<p>Perform frontline triage and threat analysis with Proofpoint Endpoint DLP, investigate anomalous access patterns in Elastic Security SIEM, and use Cisco Identity Intelligence to support secure campus systems.</p>
			</article>

			<article class="role">
				<div class="role-meta"><span>May 2025 - Present</span><span>Texas A&amp;M Department of CSE</span></div>
				<h3>Undergraduate Researcher</h3>
				<p>Study malware detection reliability under concept drift through feature extraction and benchmarks for retraining strategies such as ADWIN and TRANSCENDENT. Read the <a href="https://github.com/arnavkarekar/Concept-Drift-Detection-for-DREBIN-Dataset" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DREBIN dataset research repository</a>.</p>
			</article>

			<article class="role">
				<div class="role-meta"><span>Jun 2025 - Aug 2025</span><span>Arkansas Department of Education</span></div>
				<h3>Cybersecurity Intern</h3>
				<p>Raised Microsoft Defender Secure Score by 6 points with automated PowerShell remediation scripts and completed live-fire incident response exercises using Splunk, Security Onion, and Palo Alto Firewall.</p>
			</article>

			<article class="role">
				<div class="role-meta"><span>Sep 2024 - Nov 2024</span><span>Aggie Coding Club - Sizzler</span></div>
				<h3>Backend Developer</h3>
				<p>Developed a restaurant discovery web app for College Station with swipe mechanics and built Express.js and Supabase CRUD endpoints for user profiles and posts.</p>
			</article>

			<article class="role">
				<div class="role-meta"><span>Jun 2023 - Aug 2023</span><span>Momentum Venture Labs</span></div>
				<h3>Product Designer</h3>
				<p>Collaborated with startups such as Schoolade to improve user interface design and engagement, created structured wireframes, and began development of the Momentum social web platform.</p>
			</article>

			<article class="role">
				<div class="role-meta"><span>Aug 2020 - Mar 2021</span><span>Friends of India</span></div>
				<h3>Web Designer</h3>
				<p>Spearheaded development of a Squarespace site during COVID-19 and led a team of student developers in designing an accessible, mission-driven online presence.</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<footer>More work and experiments live at <a href="https://arnavkarekar.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">arnavkarekar.com</a>.</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
